  partName: Front Cover Plate
  description: The Front Cover Plate is a tiny, thin-flat plate positioned at the
    bottom-center-front of the engine, serving as a protective cover for various
    engine components. Its small size and thin shape allow it to fit snugly over
    the components, shielding them from debris and damage. Notably, the plate's material
    composition, Material.003, provides excellent durability and resistance to corrosion,
    ensuring a long service life.
